{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56379","headline":"无弦琴赋附歌 · 张随","name":"无弦琴赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐无声兮情逾倍，琴无弦兮意弥在。\n天地同和有真宰，形声何爲叠相待。\n（见《文苑英华》卷七七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张随","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}